   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roundness": null,
   "text": "Worth knowing: a replayed intent can't be proved absent for 600 s, so an early cleanup reports it unconfirmed. A label sweep always\nleaves one unconfirmed entry (the listing) and exits 3. Harbor environments other than Blaxel and Daytona are not tracked at all.",
   "originalText": "Worth knowing: a replayed intent can't be proved absent for 600 s, so an early cleanup reports it unconfirmed. A label sweep always\nleaves one unconfirmed entry (the listing) and exits 3. Harbor environments other than Blaxel and Daytona are not tracked at all.",
